-- "Przemiana" (Kiciamol, 16-17 October): a GM plays a bot of the population
-- and goes back to his GM. The rules are gm_possess.lua's (libs/other, loaded
-- by the image); the client half is gmpossess.py. login() tells a GM's client
-- and a possessed character's that the quest is here (GMPossessReady) and
-- ends at a GM's login what a session left; the button carries the client's
-- requests - possess <name>, check, release, cancel.
quest gm_possess begin
	state start begin
		when login begin
			gm_possess_lib.login()
		end
		when gm_possess_retry.timer begin
			gm_possess_lib.login()
		end
		when button begin
			cmdchat("GMPossessInput")
			gm_possess_lib.request(input())
		end
	end
end
